1
00:00:00,810 --> 00:00:02,140
(Raj:)There it is, Priya.
We're Indian.

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,180
(Raj:)We believe this stuff.

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:07,410
(Priya:)I think it also says that
if you eat beef,

4
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:09,580
(Priya:)you need to live with cows
for three months

5
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,750
(Priya:)and drink their urine.

6
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:14,120
(Raj:)Some of it makes sense,
some of it's crazy.

7
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:17,060
(Raj:)My point is, you can't go out
with Leonard.

8
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,490
(Penny(arriving):)Who can't go out with Leonard?

9
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:19,730
(Raj:)My sister.

10
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:22,290
(Leonard:)Penny, this is
Raj's sister, Priya.

11
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,660
(Priya:)It's very nice to meet you.

12
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:26,000
(Penny:)Oh, yeah, you, too.

13
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,270
(Sheldon:)Priya, if you're experiencing
any tension or awkwardness,

14
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:32,350
(Sheldon:)it may stem from the fact that
Leonard and Penny used to--

15
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:36,010
(Sheldon:)if I may quote Howard--
"do the dance with no pants."

16
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,110
(Penny:)Sheldon!

17
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,350
(Leonard:)Really?

18
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:46,070
(Howard:)Hey, Bernadette, can I
talk to you for a second?

19
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:48,190
(Leonard:)Sure.

20
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:50,460
(Raj:)Penny, you became disenchanted
with Leonard

21
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:51,520
(Raj:)as a lover.

22
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:53,830
(Raj:)Would you please tell
my sister why?

23
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,880
(Howard:)Listen, my mom's
going to Palm Springs

24
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,200
(Howard:)to visit her sister.

25
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,630
(Howard:)That's two whole nights
in a row I can sleep over

